# TF2's Thermal Thruster (specs/tf2/batch3b_mechanics.md 9.3): a Pyro with
# the Flame Thrower draws the thruster (slot 2), aims a little up and
# presses attack: a hop, 0.65 s later the launch (810 along the aim, 315
# up near level), the HUD's item meter (THRUSTER) at half; seen from
# behind in third person. Needs the item pack (an asset store with
# `items`).
#   CHIMERA_ASSET_STORE=<store> cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/tf2_thruster.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 120
god
sandbox ammo on
rung tf2:tf_weapon_flamethrower
wait 2
give tf2:thermal_thruster
wait 2
slot2
wait_for idle 3000
wait 120
sandbox thirdperson on
cam_idealdist 260
cam_idealyaw 30
setang -15 180
wait 30
shot thruster_ready
+attack
gwait 0.1
-attack
gwait 0.3
shot hop
gwait 0.4
shot launched
gwait 0.3
shot flying
gwait 0.4
shot flying_later
gwait 2.0
shot landed
